00:02:01.360 --> 00:02:05.200
to take a screenshot on a mac you quite

00:02:03.119 --> 00:02:06.399
simply need to find the folder or the

00:02:05.200 --> 00:02:07.600
document that you wish to take a

00:02:06.399 --> 00:02:09.360
