00:02:07.600 --> 00:02:11.680
make sure that it is displayed clearly

00:02:09.360 --> 00:02:13.440
on the screen and there are two options

00:02:11.680 --> 00:02:14.800
you can take a snapshot of the

00:02:13.440 --> 00:02:17.440
everything that's on the screen at that

00:02:14.800 --> 00:02:20.480
moment in time or you can specify

00:02:17.440 --> 00:02:21.920
a specific area to take a snapshot of

00:02:20.480 --> 00:02:22.400
exactly what's on the screen at that

00:02:21.920 --> 00:02:25.680
time

00:02:22.400 --> 00:02:27.680
you can press the shift key

00:02:25.680 --> 00:02:28.720
and the command key and hold those down

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:31.680
and then press the

00:02:28.720 --> 00:02:33.360
number three you will hear the sound of

00:02:31.680 --> 00:02:35.280
a camera clicking which indicates that

00:02:33.360 --> 00:02:38.319
it has taken the screenshot

00:02:35.280 --> 00:02:39.840
you can then go to the word document

00:02:38.319 --> 00:02:41.200
in this example i'm just using a blank

00:02:39.840 --> 00:02:43.200
one book when you're providing

00:02:41.200 --> 00:02:44.160
