00:02:44.160 --> 00:02:49.120
booklet so what i need to do then is

00:02:46.239 --> 00:02:51.760
hold down the control key and press v

00:02:49.120 --> 00:02:53.519
and that will provide a screenshot so

00:02:51.760 --> 00:02:54.720
it's basically took a picture of what

00:02:53.519 --> 00:02:57.200
was on the screen

00:02:54.720 --> 00:02:59.760
and that has now been entered into the

00:02:57.200 --> 00:02:59.760
document

